OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFour men jailed over Heathrow tear
OL,4,Agas attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been jailed after an
OL,7,Fincident of "serious and sustained"
OL,8,Fviolence in which tear gas was sprayed
OL,9,Fat a Heathrow Airport car park.
OL,11,FThe substance "believed to be CS spray"
OL,12,Fwas sprayed into a lift at a
OL,13,Fmulti-storey car park at Terminal 3 on
OL,14,F7 December. It was then sprayed in the
OL,15,Fface of a woman who was followed to a
OL,16,Ftaxi rank and had her suitcase stolen.
OL,18,FFive people were taken to hospital and
OL,19,Fthe terminal was closed for hours after
OL,20,Fthe incident.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
